    "description": "Calculate landscaping profit margin with direct costs, fees, overhead and owner pay. Compare price changes, monthly job goals and delivery capacity.",
    "metaDescription": "Calculate landscaping profit margin with direct costs, fees, overhead and owner pay. Compare price changes, monthly job goals and delivery capacity.",
