    "opening": "The example crew invoices $18,000 for 40 jobs and has $3,260 left after the listed job costs, fees, overhead and owner pay. Its planning profit margin is 18.11%, while the contribution margin before those monthly requirements is 57%.",
    "unit": "sales",
